###############################################################################
# BASE PACKAGES (00)
#
# Purpose:
#   Minimal, foundational system packages required for a usable Arch install.
#   These should be safe, boring, and almost always installed.
#
# What belongs here:
#   - Core system utilities (coreutils, util-linux, grep, sed, awk)
#   - Filesystem tools
#   - Networking basics (NetworkManager, iw, wireless tools)
#   - Arch fundamentals (base, base-devel if required early)
#
# What does NOT belong here:
#   - Desktop / GUI applications
#   - Window managers or Wayland/X11 components
#   - User shells, prompts, or theming tools
#
###############################################################################


base
base-devel
linux
linux-firmware
sudo
networkmanager
git
neovim
curl
wget
openssh